  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">流浪商人會離開模組新增一種簡單方式，讓流浪商人離開地圖，無需訴諸暴力。它在交易畫面左上角新增一個小按鈕。點擊後，商人會在一團粒子效果中消失。你不再需要殺死它來換取片刻安寧。<br><br>商人的駱馬也會消失，但僅限於牠們被拴繩繫在商人時。此行為可在設定中更改。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端和伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>despawnTraderLlamasToo</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在按下按鈕時，讓商人駱馬與流浪商人一同消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyDespawnLlamasWhenLeashed</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否僅在駱馬被拴繩繫在流浪商人時才讓牠們消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showDespawnParticles</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在流浪商人及/或商人駱馬消失時顯示粒子效果。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/wandering-trader spawn</em> - 不小心讓流浪商人離開了？重生回來吧！<br><strong>此指令需要作弊權限。</strong></span></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新增了一個小按鈕：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wandering-trader-may-leave/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>只需點擊按鈕，然後噗的一聲！</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wandering-trader-may-leave/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載連結仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概述和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
